@*
    WizardThinkingIndicator — animated "thinking" gap before the first
    TextDelta arrives.

    Shown while WizardAnswerStream is in the Thinking state (Submitted but
    no chunks have arrived yet — i.e., the Foundry agent is processing the
    question). Hidden when the first TextDelta, Refusal, or Final arrives.

    Accessibility:
      • role="status" + aria-live="polite" so screen readers announce the
        thinking message without interrupting the user.
      • prefers-reduced-motion: the CSS animation is gated via
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce). In reduced-motion mode the
        dots are rendered statically at their mid-opacity so the indicator
        is still visible but does not animate.

    Category: delight surface (within WizardAnswerStream scope per ADR-0026
    § 6). Uses MudBlazor primitives for the outer container — custom only for
    the animated dot row.

    ADR-0026 § 3 — streaming state machine; Thinking state
    ADR-0008     — MudBlazor strict
*@

<div class="wizard-thinking-indicator"
     data-testid="wizard-thinking-indicator"
     role="status"
     aria-live="polite"
     aria-label="Wizard is thinking">

    <MudStack Row="true" Spacing="1" AlignItems="AlignItems.Center">
        <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Color="Color.Secondary"
                 Class="wizard-thinking-indicator__label">
            Wizard is thinking
        </MudText>
        <span class="wizard-thinking-indicator__dots" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="wizard-thinking-indicator__dot wizard-thinking-indicator__dot--1"></span>
            <span class="wizard-thinking-indicator__dot wizard-thinking-indicator__dot--2"></span>
            <span class="wizard-thinking-indicator__dot wizard-thinking-indicator__dot--3"></span>
        </span>
    </MudStack>

</div>
